'''E-569''' is one of the six unfinished [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku Enemies]] whose IDs are between [[Wicked Axe Cat (Enemy)|Wicked Axe Cat]] and [[Dark Priest Mamon]] and with placeholder stats. It is an [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] variant of [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Titan Cat]]. It was added in [[Version 10.9 Update|Version 10.9]].

